llamazig
========

This project is a port of llama.cpp to Zig. It is a derivative work: the code
under `src/` is a line-by-line translation of C and C++ from the llama.cpp
project, not an independent implementation. Each ported file names the source
file and the pinned commit it was translated from.

llamazig itself is MIT licensed; see LICENSE.


