zigjinja
--------

Chat templating uses https://github.com/inferise/zigjinja, which is MIT
licensed. It is a fork of https://github.com/gremlin-labs/vibe-jinja and
carries both copyrights. It is consumed as a pinned dependency rather than
vendored, so its licence text travels with the dependency itself. If it is
ever vendored into this repository, its notice must be reproduced here.
